'''Fantina''' (Japanese: '''メリッサ''' ''Melissa'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Take a {{e|Psychic}} Energy from your Energy Zone and attach it to each of your {{TCGP|Drifblim}} and {{TCGP|Mismagius}}.
}}

