==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Fantina}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Fantina]] is the [[Gym Leader]] of the [[Hearthome Gym]].
*{{p|Drifblim}} and {{p|Mismagius}} are Pokémon that Fantina uses in Pokémon {{3v2|Diamond|Pearl|Platinum}}, {{2v2|Black|White|2}} and {{pkmn|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

